## Special cases:

## There is a resource-config.json file generated by nativeimage.gradle if you use Graal Native Image.
## Some usage may need extra resource configuration in a different file with the same name.
## You could also add that configuration to the text in nativeimage.gradle .
## You should delete or comment out the next line if you have configuration in a different resource-config.json .
**/resource-config.json

# Display-sized textures regenerated by Gradle from original assets.
/assets/runtime/

# Standalone distribution archives are published as release assets.
/generated/distributions/

# Reproducible local character QA captures (JSON reports remain versioned).
/generated/puppeteer-preview/*.png
/generated/lobby-character-polish/*.png

# Local synchronized lobby transition captures.
/generated/lobby-start/

/generated/question-players/

/generated/previews/impostor-characters.png

# Local modular shotgun preview captures and QA configurations.
/generated/shotgun/

# Python tooling caches and scratch QA outputs; original assets remain local.
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
/generated/tmp/

# Reproducible mobile presentation captures; keep the JSON report.
/generated/controller-polish/*.png

# Private local media: keep working files, never commit game art/audio or visual captures.
# GLB/Blend containers can embed image textures. History is not removed by these rules.

# Images and texture formats
*.[pP][nN][gG]
*.[jJ][pP][gG]
*.[jJ][pP][eE][gG]
*.[wW][eE][bB][pP]
*.[gG][iI][fF]
*.[bB][mM][pP]
*.[tT][gG][aA]
*.[tT][iI][fF]
*.[tT][iI][fF][fF]
*.[sS][vV][gG]
*.[iI][cC][oO]
*.[iI][cC][nN][sS]
*.[aA][vV][iI][fF]
*.[aA][pP][nN][gG]
*.[kK][tT][xX]
*.[kK][tT][xX]2
*.[dD][dD][sS]
*.[hH][dD][rR]
*.[eE][xX][rR]
*.[bB][aA][sS][iI][sS]
*.[aA][sS][tT][cC]
*.[pP][vV][rR]
*.[pP][kK][mM]
*.[qQ][oO][iI]

